WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:13.920
99% of people delete their entire password
and start over if they mess up just one letter.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:19.140
Buckingham Palace has 602 rooms.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:25.230
The largest sperm bank in the world does not
accept donations from redheads because of

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.560
'insufficient demand'.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:33.899
Facebook founder Mark Zuckerberg only eats
meat from animals he has killed himself.

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:39.809
Reno, Nevada is farther west than Los Angeles,
California.

00:00:39.809 --> 00:00:46.399
Sigurd the Mighty, a ninth-century Norse earl
of Orkney, was killed by an enemy he had beheaded

00:00:46.399 --> 00:00:48.989
several hours earlier.

00:00:48.989 --> 00:00:54.859
He'd tied the man's head to his horse's saddle,
but while riding home one of its protruding

00:00:54.859 --> 00:00:56.579
teeth grazed his leg.

00:00:56.579 --> 00:00:59.670
He died from the infection.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:04.559
Insects outnumber humans 100 million to one.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:10.860
A blue whales heart only beats nine times
per minute.

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:16.370
Some fruit flies are genetically resistant
to getting drunk — but only if they have

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:21.460
an inactive version of a gene scientists have
named “happyhour”.

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:28.079
Americans spend more on dog food every year
than they spend on baby food.

00:01:28.079 --> 00:01:34.119
When male fruit flies are given alcohol they
develop homosexual tendencies.

00:01:34.119 --> 00:01:40.140
Your body paralyzes itself when you sleep
to keep you from acting out your dreams.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:45.979
St George is the patron saint of England,
leprosy and syphilis.

00:01:45.979 --> 00:01:50.939
Hair is made from the same substance as fingernails.

00:01:50.939 --> 00:01:57.079
When Columbus apparently 'discovered' the
New World, there were at least 50 million

00:01:57.079 --> 00:02:08.619
people living in the Americas.

